<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK			  RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America    11.60/11.50    12.10 /11.95   12.625/12.50</p>
<p>Citibank	     11.625/11.50   12.125/11.90   12.70 /12.55</p>
<p>Metrobank	    11.65 /11.45   12.30/11.95    12.65 /12.50</p>
<p>Multinational	11.65 /11.55   12.15 /11.95   12.625/12.50</p>
<p>PNB		    11.525/11.475  12.125/11.90   12.70/12.575</p>
<p>StanChart	    11.565/11.465  12.05 /11.95   12.60 /12.50</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone on (632) 841 8934</p>
